cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BioPhasor in your research, please cite the software and the relevant preprint below."
title: "BioPhasor: Phasor Dynamics Library for Multi-Omics Data"
abstract: >-
  BioPhasor is a Python library for phasor-based omics analysis and multi-omics
  integration. It encodes biological measurements as complex numbers on the unit
  circle, enabling circular statistics, phase coherence analysis, and
  oscillatory dynamics for genomics, transcriptomics, proteomics, and
  metabolomics data.
type: software
